full_article:
Koderma (Jharkhand), Aug 14 (PTI) At least three ‘kanwariyas’ from Nepal were killed and 10 others were injured when a bus carrying the pilgrims rammed into a stationary vehicle in Jharkhand’s Koderma district on Friday, police said.

